#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/financial.page:10
msgid "When in financial mode the following buttons are available."
msgstr "Finansiālajā režīmā ir pieejamas šādas pogas."

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:15
msgid "Ctrm"
msgstr "Ster"

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:16
msgid ""
"Calculate the number of compounding periods necessary to increase an "
"investment of present value to a future value, at a fixed interest rate per "
"compounding period."
msgstr ""
"Aprēķina, cik procentu kapitalizācijas periodu vajadzīgs, lai ieguldījuma "
"pašreizējā vērtība pieaugtu līdz nākotnes vērtībai ar nemainīgu procentu "
"likmi katrā periodā."

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:19
msgid "Ddb"
msgstr "Pa"

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:20
msgid ""
"Calculate the depreciation allowance on an asset for a specified period of "
"time, using the double-declining balance method."
msgstr ""
"Aprēķina aktīva nolietojumu noteiktā periodā ar divkārši dilstošā atlikuma "
"metodi."

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:23
msgid "Fv"
msgstr "Vn"

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:24
msgid ""
"Calculate the future value of an investment based on a series of equal "
"payments at a periodic interest rate over the number of payment periods in "
"the term."
msgstr ""
"Aprēķina ieguldījuma nākotnes vērtību, ja termiņa laikā veic vienādus "
"maksājumus ar periodisku procentu likmi."

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:27
msgid "Gpm"
msgstr "Bpn"

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:28
msgid ""
"Calculate the resale price of a product, based on the product cost and the "
"wanted gross profit margin."
msgstr ""
"Aprēķina produkta pārdošanas cenu, ņemot vērā produkta pašizmaksu un vēlamo "
"bruto peļņas normu."

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:31
msgid "Pmt"
msgstr "Pmk"

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:32
msgid ""
"Calculate the amount of the periodic payment of a loan, where payments are "
"made at the end of each payment period."
msgstr ""
"Aprēķina aizdevuma periodiskā maksājuma summu, ja maksājumi tiek veikti "
"katra maksājuma perioda beigās."

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:35
msgid "Pv"
msgstr "Pv"

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:36
msgid ""
"Calculate the present value of an investment based on a series of equal "
"payments discounted at a periodic interest rate over the number of payment "
"periods in the term."
msgstr ""
"Aprēķina ieguldījuma pašreizējo vērtību, ja termiņa laikā veic vienādus "
"maksājumus, kas diskontēti ar periodisku procentu likmi."

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:39
msgid "Rate"
msgstr "Ātrums"

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:40
msgid ""
"Calculate the periodic interest necessary to increase an investment to a "
"future value, over the number of compounding periods."
msgstr ""
"Aprēķina periodisko procentu likmi, kas vajadzīga, lai ieguldījums noteiktā "
"kapitalizācijas periodu skaitā pieaugtu līdz nākotnes vērtībai."

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:43
msgid "Sln"
msgstr "Lam"

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:44
msgid ""
"Calculate the straight-line depreciation of an asset for one period. The "
"straight-line method of depreciation divides the depreciable cost evenly "
"over the useful life of an asset. The useful life is the number of periods, "
"typically years, over which an asset is depreciated."
msgstr ""
"Aprēķina aktīva lineāro nolietojumu vienam periodam. Lineārā nolietojuma "
"metode nolietojamo vērtību vienmērīgi sadala pa visu aktīva lietderīgās "
"izmantošanas laiku. Lietderīgās izmantošanas laiks ir periodu (parasti gadu) "
"skaits, kurā aktīvs tiek nolietots."

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:47
msgid "Syd"
msgstr "Gcsn"

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:48
msgid ""
"Calculate the depreciation allowance on an asset for a specified period of "
"time, using the Sum-of-the-Years'-Digits method. This method of depreciation"
" accelerates the rate of depreciation, so that more depreciation expense "
"occurs in earlier periods than in later ones. The useful life is the number "
"of periods, typically years, over which an asset is depreciated."
msgstr ""
"Aprēķina aktīva nolietojumu noteiktā periodā ar gadu skaitļu summas metodi. "
"Šī metode paātrina nolietojumu, tāpēc agrākajos periodos nolietojuma "
"izmaksas ir lielākas nekā vēlākajos. Lietderīgās izmantošanas laiks ir "
"periodu (parasti gadu) skaits, kurā aktīvs tiek nolietots."

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:51
msgid "Term"
msgstr "Termiņš"

#. (itstool) path: td/p
#: C/financial.page:52
msgid ""
"Calculate the number of payment periods that are necessary during the term "
"of an ordinary annuity, to accumulate a future value, at a periodic interest"
" rate."
msgstr ""
"Aprēķina, cik maksājumu periodu vajadzīgs parastas anuitātes termiņā, lai ar "
"periodisku procentu likmi uzkrātu nākotnes vērtību."

